y","subtitle":"College Street corridor · 107 S College St","notes":"Turn onto College Street for a bagel, pastry or locally roasted coffee; verify the day’s operating hours before walking over.","short_summary":"A downtown coffeehouse serving breakfast food and pastries.","evidence_claim":"Established local media lists Coffee Cat Coffeehouse at 107 S College St and describes its offerings as bagels, burritos, pastries and locally roasted coffee.","source_url":"https://newsberg.org/2025/11/25/newberg-guide-to-shopping-local-for-the-holiday-season/","source_title":"Newberg Guide to Shopping Local for the Holiday Season","source_kind":"local_media","source_published_at":"2025-11-25","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Coffee%20Cat%20Coffeehouse%20107%20S%20College%20St%20Newberg%20OR","access_notes":"Food and drinks require purchase. Current operating hours should be confirmed with the coffeehouse before visiting.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"nikki-janes-boutique-first-street","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Nikki Jane’s Boutique","title":"Browse the Accessories Collection","subtitle":"First Street corridor · 602 E First St, Suite B","notes":"Step into the First Street shop to compare its apparel, handbags, jewelry and other accessories without assuming current stock.","short_summary":"A downtown boutique carrying apparel and accessories.","evidence_claim":"Nikki Jane’s official site lists its shop at 602 E 1st St, Suite B and says it carries women’s clothing, necklaces, earrings, scarves and handbags.","source_url":"https://nikkijanesboutique.com/","source_title":"Nikki Jane’s Boutique","source_kind":"business_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nikki%20Janes%20Boutique%20602%20E%201st%20St%20Su